<title>UK: Huntington Nat'l Bank sets $250 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Huntington Nat'l Bank sets $250 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HUNTINGTON NATIONAL BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +10 BP    PAY DATE    02.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.915    FULL FEES   22.5 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.915</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    16 BP     SELL CONC  6.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SENIOR, UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
